Z||000000||lawrence||04-16-2000||05:17 PM||||Group,<P>I have a project that requires the socket "holes" from a tail light.  I need to put dual filament sockets into a fixture, so I will cut out the reflectors and put them into the other fixture.  In other words, I just need the reflector piece of a broken tail light assembly.  I need four holes, so one reflector piece should do it.<P>I'll pay shipping and buy you a couple of beers for your trouble.<P>Can anyone help me?<P>-L<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
